 "description": "eth_getCode size check: bytecode length plus whether the address is a contract at all \u2014 the two-second answer to 'did I just send funds to an EOA'. Costs $0.001 USDC per call. Chains: base, ethereum, arbitrum, bsc, polygon, optimism, avalanche. Byte-identical to GET /chain/code?chain=base&address=0x833589fCD6eDb6E08f4c7C32D4f71b54bdA02913.",
